<title>POLAND: Petrobank Q1 net rises to PLN 4.9 mln.</title>
<headline>Petrobank Q1 net rises to PLN 4.9 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrobank preliminary results for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 8.52  vs    3.70</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   8.52  vs    3.70</p>
<p>    net profit				 4.88  vs    2.19</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Petrobank SA.</p>
<p>    revenues from securities		na   vs     na</p>
<p>    interest and similar revenues     24.19  vs   15.43</p>
<p>    interest and similar costs	   9.08  vs    7.81</p>
<p>@</p>
<p>    revenues from commission	     1.15  vs    1.00</p>
<p>    costs of commission		    0.20  vs    0.06</p>
<p>    income tax				 3.64  vs    1.52</p>
<p>    other taxes				 na   vs     na</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		    na   vs     na</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
